      "subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "5C18E21ED6A34AC6",
      "title": "&f&lRotation, speed and stress&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fCreate machinery needs a connected rotating network. Speed changes can also change stress requirements. Inspect the machine and network feedback before adding more equipment or gearing up.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fWhen a line stalls, check the output, rotation and stress status before rebuilding the recipe.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "361CFFD75A6AFDD5"
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "462465B2F7C20959",
          "type": "checkmark",
