    },
    {
      "id": "7EBC9C739384C57D",
      "title": "&f&lDeploy the mechanism onto its casing&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fA machine frame is assembled by deploying its mechanism onto the matching casing. Functional machines combine a frame with matching mechanical parts. Stonecutting remains useful for the listed passive fittings; every choice consumes its frame.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fProduce the correct casing.",
        "&62. &fDeploy its matching mechanism.",
        "&63. &fFollow the machine’s exact recipe: frame plus working parts. Use stonecutting only for listed passive fittings.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fOnly the first Kinetic Machine has the expensive raw-material startup shortcut.",
        "",
        "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "361CFFD75A6AFDD5"
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5BE97F6179188A46",
          "type": "checkmark",
          "title": "Complete this activity"
        }
      ],
