      ],
      "subtitle": "&7FIELD GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "4D9BC82EAF764CBA",
      "title": "&f&lA renewable wood line&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fA Create tree farm needs harvesting, sapling supply, replanting and output transfer. Plan each job before scaling the contraption. Supported wood processing cuts logs into stripped logs, then six planks.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fTest the selected tree type on a small area.",
        "&62. &fAdd harvesting and replanting.",
        "&63. &fTransfer the harvest into a wood buffer.",
        "&64. &fSend only the needed logs into processing.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fKeep a protected sapling reserve so downstream crafting cannot eat the next planting batch.",
        "",
        "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "361CFFD75A6AFDD5"
      ],
