    {
      "id": "35991A6495F991A9",
      "title": "&f&lSlice & Dice in the kitchen&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fThe Slicer automates supported Farmer’s Delight cutting recipes with the appropriate held knife. The Sprinkler belongs to the field-and-fluid tier. Inspect the actual supported cutting recipe and water arrangement before scaling.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fPut a knife replacement plan next to the kitchen ingredients.",
        "",
        "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
