      "title": "&f&lStorage on a contraption&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fThe selected Sophisticated integrations connect storage and backpacks to Create systems. Test the supported inventory on a small contraption and confirm which upgrades and transfers work there.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fVerify that cargo leaves the moving inventory before extending the farm.",
