    {
      "id": "773322A64003CBA0",
      "title": "&f&lLiquid experience and enchantments&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fEnchantment Industry gives experience-processing equipment and its native enchanting rules. Use the Chapter V routes, keep XP apart from water and other fluids, and check the selected recipe for the desired operation.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fA liquid XP supply does not make every enchantment free or remove native requirements.",
        "",
        "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
